  m_Name: WarmEgg
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DungeonCards.EventData
  eventName: Warm Egg
  body: Nestled in a bowl of old straw is an egg the size of your fist. It is warm, and it is moving. A single pale feather lies beside it. Whatever laid this is not far.
  options:
  - label: Take the feather and leave the egg
    resultText: You lift the feather and back away, slowly, with the whole nest undisturbed.
    effect:
      healthChange: 0
      permanentMaxHealth: 0
      attribute: 0
      attributeChange: 0
      experienceChange: 0
      goldChange: 0
